418	10. For each suggested module, populate ALL sub-section arrays completely — topics (all subject areas covered), lessonTasks (with ACS references and performance standards), assignments (2-4 practical exercises), resources (FAA publications, links, and tools), endorsements (only if this module satisfies a specific FAA endorsement requirement), and regulations (all applicable FARs and AIM references). Empty arrays are acceptable only when a section genuinely does not apply (e.g. endorsements for most ground lessons).`;
419	
420	    try {
